From: logdog2325 <226450061+logdog2325@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 14:04:18 -0800
Subject: [PATCH] XD Netplay: battle recorder (Showdown replay and text log per
 battle), replacing the link transcript

Reads XD's battle state once per field: moves by PP drop, HP, faints, switches,
status and stat stages, written to GBA/Battle Records per battle. Only reads memory.
v1.8.1 (test build)
